OL,3,AGlobal tech stocks plunge as US
OL,4,Amidterms add to AI slowdown fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrillions of dollars have been wiped
OL,7,Foff the stock value of major tech firms
OL,8,Fin the US, Europe and Asia amid
OL,9,Fconcerns of a slowdown in AI
OL,10,Fdevelopment
OL,12,FIt comes after the US midterm
OL,13,Felections, in which a number of
OL,14,FDemocrats campaigned to slow the growth
OL,15,Fof AI data centres - Gina Hinojosa, who
OL,16,Fwon in Texas, pledged to halt new
OL,17,Fcentre construction entirely
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
