OL,3,AGlobal tech stocks plunge as US
OL,4,Amidterms add to AI slowdown fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Nasdaq index, of the largest tech
OL,7,Ffirms listed in the US, was down by
OL,8,Fmore than 5.5% by the end of Thursday;
OL,9,FJapan's Nikkei 225 was down 6.3%
OL,10,Fearlier
OL,12,FSome of the larger losses in Asia came
OL,13,Ffrom memory chip makers - Japan, South
OL,14,FKorea and Taiwan make most of the chips
OL,15,Fand equipment for US data centres
OL,17,FAnd in the UK the FTSE 100 index has
OL,18,Ffallen by 1.6% - the lack of tech
OL,19,Fshares on the London Stock Exchange
OL,20,Fmeans it tends to be less exposed to
OL,21,Fsell-offs in the AI sector, says our
OL,22,Fbusiness reporter
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
